### =====================================================================
### Washermann — Order Engine Smoke Test (VS Code REST Client / Postman)
### Run top-to-bottom. Each "# @name X" response feeds later requests.
### Prereqs (see order-engine-qa-runbook.md):
###   - API running on {{API}}
###   - An ACTIVE conversion_rate row exists (seed/DB — the POST endpoint is
###     guarded by a security answer). SQL fallback in the runbook.
###   - Seeded admin: admin@washermann.com / Admin@1234
### =====================================================================

@API = http://localhost:3009/api/v1
@adminEmail = admin@washermann.com
@adminPass = Admin@1234

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### STAGE 0 — Admin + area
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name adminLogin
POST {{API}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPass}}" }

###
@adminTok = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

# @name createArea
POST {{API}}/areas
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Smoke VI", "state": "Lagos" }

###
@areaId = {{createArea.response.body.data.id}}

### Confirm an active conversion rate exists (must NOT 404)
GET {{API}}/conversion-rates/active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### STAGE 1 — Catalogue (capture 3 everyday item ids)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name everydayItems
GET {{API}}/catalogue/items?everyday=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}

###
@itemA = {{everydayItems.response.body.data[0].id}}
@itemB = {{everydayItems.response.body.data[1].id}}
@itemC = {{everydayItems.response.body.data[2].id}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### STAGE 2 — Three verified vendors price items A/B/C (feeds P70)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Vendor 1 (A=800, B=1000, C=3000) ---
# @name vendor1
POST {{API}}/auth/vendor/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Smoke Vendor 1", "email": "smoke-v1-{{$timestamp}}@test.io", "password": "StrongP@ssw0rd" }

###
@v1Tok = {{vendor1.response.body.data.accessToken}}

# @name v1Profile
GET {{API}}/vendors/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{v1Tok}}

###
POST {{API}}/vendors/{{v1Profile.response.body.data.id}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}

# @name v1Pricing
POST {{API}}/vendors/me/pricing
Authorization: Bearer {{v1Tok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [
  { "itemId": "{{itemA}}", "garmentType": "item-a", "priceNaira": 800 },
  { "itemId": "{{itemB}}", "garmentType": "item-b", "priceNaira": 1000 },
  { "itemId": "{{itemC}}", "garmentType": "item-c", "priceNaira": 3000 }
] }

###
POST {{API}}/vendors/pricing/{{v1Pricing.response.body.data.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}

# --- Vendor 2 (A=1200, B=1500, C=4000) ---
# @name vendor2
POST {{API}}/auth/vendor/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Smoke Vendor 2", "email": "smoke-v2-{{$timestamp}}@test.io", "password": "StrongP@ssw0rd" }

###
@v2Tok = {{vendor2.response.body.data.accessToken}}

# @name v2Profile
GET {{API}}/vendors/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{v2Tok}}

###
POST {{API}}/vendors/{{v2Profile.response.body.data.id}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}

# @name v2Pricing
POST {{API}}/vendors/me/pricing
Authorization: Bearer {{v2Tok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [
  { "itemId": "{{itemA}}", "garmentType": "item-a", "priceNaira": 1200 },
  { "itemId": "{{itemB}}", "garmentType": "item-b", "priceNaira": 1500 },
  { "itemId": "{{itemC}}", "garmentType": "item-c", "priceNaira": 4000 }
] }

###
POST {{API}}/vendors/pricing/{{v2Pricing.response.body.data.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}

# --- Vendor 3 (A=2000, B=2500, C=5000) ---
# @name vendor3
POST {{API}}/auth/vendor/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Smoke Vendor 3", "email": "smoke-v3-{{$timestamp}}@test.io", "password": "StrongP@ssw0rd" }

###
@v3Tok = {{vendor3.response.body.data.accessToken}}

# @name v3Profile
GET {{API}}/vendors/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{v3Tok}}

###
POST {{API}}/vendors/{{v3Profile.response.body.data.id}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}

# @name v3Pricing
POST {{API}}/vendors/me/pricing
Authorization: Bearer {{v3Tok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [
  { "itemId": "{{itemA}}", "garmentType": "item-a", "priceNaira": 2000 },
  { "itemId": "{{itemB}}", "garmentType": "item-b", "priceNaira": 2500 },
  { "itemId": "{{itemC}}", "garmentType": "item-c", "priceNaira": 5000 }
] }

###
POST {{API}}/vendors/pricing/{{v3Pricing.response.body.data.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### STAGE 3 — Compute platform prices (P70 + charges)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### Expect: priced >= 3, items A/B/C now isAvailable
POST {{API}}/pricing/items/recompute
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}

### Inspect item A breakdown (base P70 ~1520 for A + charge stack)
GET {{API}}/pricing/items/{{itemA}}/breakdown
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### STAGE 4 — Bags + Bundles (auto-priced)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name createBag
POST {{API}}/bags
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Smoke Medium Bag", "allowedItemCount": 10 }

###
@bagId = {{createBag.response.body.data.id}}

# @name createBundle
POST {{API}}/bundles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Smoke Family Pack", "lines": [
  { "lineType": "item", "itemId": "{{itemA}}", "quantity": 2 },
  { "lineType": "item", "itemId": "{{itemB}}", "quantity": 3 },
  { "lineType": "item", "itemId": "{{itemC}}", "quantity": 1 }
] }

###
@bundleId = {{createBundle.response.body.data.id}}

### Optional: apply a 10% promo
PATCH {{API}}/bundles/{{bundleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isPromo": true, "promoType": "percentage", "promoValue": 10 }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### STAGE 5 — Customer setup, browse, quote
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name customer
POST {{API}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Smoke Customer", "email": "smoke-cust-{{$timestamp}}@test.io", "phone": "+23480{{$randomInt 10000000 99999999}}", "password": "StrongP@ssw0rd" }

###
@custTok = {{customer.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@custId = {{customer.response.body.data.user.id}}

### saved address (order-eligibility gate needs phone + 1 address)
POST {{API}}/users/me/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{custTok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "addressText": "12 Smoke Street, Victoria Island, Lagos" }

### fund the WP wallet (admin credit)
POST {{API}}/wallets/{{custId}}/credit
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 200000, "description": "Smoke test funding" }

### eligibility should be complete
GET {{API}}/users/me/profile-completion
Authorization: Bearer {{custTok}}

### live quote — wash & iron
POST {{API}}/quote/wash-iron
Authorization: Bearer {{custTok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "selections": [ { "itemId": "{{itemA}}", "qty": 2 }, { "itemId": "{{itemB}}", "qty": 1 } ] }

### live quote — bag
GET {{API}}/quote/bag/{{bagId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{custTok}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### STAGE 6 — Place one order per flow
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name orderIron
POST {{API}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{custTok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "flow": "wash_iron", "selections": [ { "itemId": "{{itemA}}", "qty": 2 }, { "itemId": "{{itemB}}", "qty": 1 } ],
  "areaId": "{{areaId}}", "pickupAddress": "12 Smoke Street, VI", "scheduledPickupAt": "2026-07-01T10:00:00Z" }

###
@orderIronId = {{orderIron.response.body.data.order.id}}

# @name orderFold
POST {{API}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{custTok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "flow": "wash_fold", "bagId": "{{bagId}}",
  "areaId": "{{areaId}}", "pickupAddress": "12 Smoke Street, VI", "scheduledPickupAt": "2026-07-01T10:00:00Z" }

###
@orderFoldId = {{orderFold.response.body.data.order.id}}

# @name orderBundle
POST {{API}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{custTok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "flow": "bundle", "bundleId": "{{bundleId}}",
  "areaId": "{{areaId}}", "pickupAddress": "12 Smoke Street, VI", "scheduledPickupAt": "2026-07-01T10:00:00Z" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### STAGE 7 — Lifecycle (needs a REP token + a VENDOR token)
### Set @repTok to an active rep's token; reuse @v1Tok for the vendor.
### Use {{orderIronId}} as the order under test.
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
@repTok = PASTE_REP_TOKEN

### admin starts rep broadcast
POST {{API}}/assignment/orders/{{orderIronId}}/start-rep
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}

### rep accepts
POST {{API}}/assignment/orders/{{orderIronId}}/accept/rep
Authorization: Bearer {{repTok}}

### vendor accepts
POST {{API}}/assignment/orders/{{orderIronId}}/accept/vendor
Authorization: Bearer {{v1Tok}}

### rep: picked up
POST {{API}}/orders/{{orderIronId}}/status/picked-up
Authorization: Bearer {{repTok}}

### rep: log garment count → sets escrow split (rep share = wash-rep commission)
POST {{API}}/orders/{{orderIronId}}/garment-log
Authorization: Bearer {{repTok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "garmentLog": { "item-a": 2, "item-b": 1 } }

### vendor stages
POST {{API}}/orders/{{orderIronId}}/status/in-progress
Authorization: Bearer {{v1Tok}}

###
POST {{API}}/orders/{{orderIronId}}/status/quality-check
Authorization: Bearer {{v1Tok}}

###
POST {{API}}/orders/{{orderIronId}}/status/ready-for-delivery
Authorization: Bearer {{v1Tok}}

### rep stages
POST {{API}}/orders/{{orderIronId}}/status/rep-collected
Authorization: Bearer {{repTok}}

###
POST {{API}}/orders/{{orderIronId}}/status/out-for-delivery
Authorization: Bearer {{repTok}}

###
POST {{API}}/orders/{{orderIronId}}/status/delivered
Authorization: Bearer {{repTok}}

### customer confirms → completes → releases escrow
POST {{API}}/orders/{{orderIronId}}/confirm-delivery
Authorization: Bearer {{custTok}}

### customer rates
POST {{API}}/orders/{{orderIronId}}/rate
Authorization: Bearer {{custTok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vendorScore": 5, "repScore": 5, "comment": "Smoke OK" }

### admin fallback complete (if confirm path blocked)
# POST {{API}}/orders/{{orderIronId}}/admin/complete
# Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### STAGE 8 — Verify
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{API}}/orders/me
Authorization: Bearer {{custTok}}

###
GET {{API}}/orders/{{orderIronId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{custTok}}

###
GET {{API}}/wallets/me
Authorization: Bearer {{custTok}}

###
GET {{API}}/vendors/me/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{v1Tok}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### SUPPORTING — Suggestions + legacy migration
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### vendor suggests a missing item
POST {{API}}/catalogue/suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{v1Tok}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rawText": "Ankara Gown", "proposedPriceNaira": 3500 }

### admin lists pending
GET {{API}}/catalogue/suggestions?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}

### admin migrates legacy free-text → suggestions (idempotent)
POST {{API}}/catalogue/migrate-legacy
Authorization: Bearer {{adminTok}}
